<title>USA: Scotts to buy back 300,000 shares of stock.</title>
<headline>Scotts to buy back 300,000 shares of stock.</headline>
<dateline>MARYSVILLE, Ohio 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Scotts Co board of directors approved a resolution authorizing the repurchase of up to 300,000 shares of the company's common stock.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement it may buy back some of the stock through privately negotiated transactions. All purchases will be made before December 31, 1997, it said.</p>
<p>Scotts is a 127-year-old maker of lawn care and gardening products.</p>
